                    <h3>What are Post Office Savings Schemes?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Post Office Savings Schemes are government-backed savings options available through India Post. Different schemes are designed for different savings needs, investment periods, and financial goals, subject to the applicable rules and conditions.
                    </p>

