                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <span>Different schemes have different deposit limits, tenure, and features.</span></li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <span>Interest rates and other benefits depend on the selected scheme and applicable rules.</span></li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>
                        Post Office schemes can be considered for goals such as regular savings, future expenses, children's financial planning, retirement planning, or other planned financial requirements. The suitable scheme depends on your financial objective, investment period, and required features.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Before choosing a Post Office savings scheme, consider the deposit amount, tenure, interest rate, maturity rules, withdrawal conditions, tax treatment, eligibility, and other applicable terms. Scheme features and interest rates may change according to the applicable government rules.
                    </p>
